&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;在所需合并的记录上右键选择&lt;code&gt;Merge revision to...&lt;/code&gt;，打开选择目标窗口。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;&lt;img src="https://boiltask.com/knowledge/svn-merge/image-2-1.png"
width="739"
height="709"
srcset="https://boiltask.com/knowledge/svn-merge/image-2-1_hu_81dc18d226c1b718.png 480w, https://boiltask.com/knowledge/svn-merge/image-2-1_hu_639d9067e8426d67.png 1024w"
loading="lazy"
